Package: geomattR
Type: Package
Title: Calculate Geometric Attributes of Spatial Polygons
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Gabriel", "Ortega-Solís", , "g.ortega.solis@geomattr.org", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0516-5694"))
Description: Calculate geometric attributes of spatial polygons including area, perimeter, compactness, elongation, orientation (bearing), fractal dimension, and various shape indices. The package relies heavily on 'terra' methods and vector data objects <https://github.com/rspatial/terra>.
